  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of a Novel Nursing and Midwifery Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to improved quality of life for mothers and new-born I Malawi, Zambia and Zimbabwe. The expected result of this project is development of a critical mass of nurse and midwifery practitioners, educators, and researchers capable of solving the current and emerging health challenges to improve quality of care.</narrative>
  </description>
